      "en": "I was mute with silence. I held my peace, even from good. My sorrow was stirred.",
      "ko": "내가 잠잠하여 선한 말도 발하지 아니하니 나의 근심이 더 심하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "514ad0c47dc458208f0e5a7e3fac38004ffe0774cfb34c3ba34b9d478bcdd36c",
      "translation_text_hash": "8cb56f2f99d3dfaa598043ecedaff68d649c74231818eff2059ac7cdee238cdf",
